      [
        "Working Principle",
        "It is mainly composed of jaw crusher, ball mill, classifier, magnetic separator, flotation machine, thickener and dryer. Combined with feeder, hoist and conveyor, it can form a complete mineral processing production line.\n\nThe mined ore is first crushed by the jaw crusher. After being crushed to a reasonable fineness, it is evenly fed into the ball mill through the hoist and feeder, where the ore is crushed and ground. The fine ore material ground by the ball mill enters the next process: classification. The spiral classifier cleans and classifies the ore mixture based on the principle that solid particles with different specific gravities settle at different speeds in liquid. When the cleaned and classified mineral mixture passes through the magnetic separator, magnetic substances in the mixture are separated by magnetic force and mechanical force due to different specific magnetic susceptibility coefficients of various minerals. The mineral particles initially separated by the magnetic separator are then fed into the flotation machine. Different reagents are added according to different mineral characteristics to separate the target minerals from other substances. After the target minerals are separated, due to their high moisture content, they must be initially thickened by the thickener and then dried by the dryer to obtain dry minerals.",
